01:43:50,180 --> 01:45:09,660
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator Judge Villanueva. Chair confirms. The statement earlier made by Attorney Linden pertaining to the testimony of Mr. Marco Pineda, the Acting Register of Deeds of IGACOS, on October 1, specifically for the information of Senator Judges, pages 95 to 97, upon the inquiry made by the presiding officer, where Mr. Pineda confirmed that Nanggaling daw kasi sa mother title yung mga nakalagay sa titulo at nakalagay sa mother title Matanos pa rin at under PD 1529. Hindi po daw nila pwedeng baguhin yun at kine-carry over lang nila gamit niyang salita mula sa ina papunta sa anak nung titulo at kaya na-carry over po yung titulong yun at para malaman daw para sigurado na yun yung parehong lupa. Ay kailangan tingnan sa tax mapping sa City Assessor's Office para matingnan at makita kung yun nga po ay pareho o magkaibang piraso ng lupa yun. Chair would like to make some interjections. Atty. Tolosa, you made mention of the fact na unang dineklara yung lupa, 2013?

